  "body_html": "<h1>Ex-Ante Equilibrium Predicates</h1>\n<p>Bayesian mechanisms with transfers include integrability assumptions for\nex-ante expected utility and an ex-ante Bayesian Nash equilibrium predicate.</p>\n<p>The direct Bayesian transfer mechanism interface also provides the truthful\nstrategy profile used in revelation-principle statements.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Section 9.6, Defs. 9.41-9.43] Nisan, Roughgarden,\n  Tardos, and Vazirani, <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>,\n  <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>. Ex-ante equilibrium predicates for\n  Bayesian mechanisms.</li>\n<li>[MFoGT, Chapter 7, Section 7.4.1] Maschler, Solan, and Zamir, <em>Game\n  Theory</em>, <code>references/GameTheory.pdf</code>. Strategies, interim expectations, and\n  Bayesian Nash equilibrium.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>def:md_ex_ante_equilibrium</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
